      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b7f36dfa73e97306ccdfa02|full_name}: Those clients use some part of the network that VRChat uses, which is Photon, to send a massive amount of data instantly, causing the targeted player to \"crash\", \"disconnect\" or \"log out\" from the game. That's basically how it works.\nThe devs fix it now and then but the hackers still manage to make a new client that works.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
